# Confirmatory outputs (D37 只算不存, amended Review 12 D50): the per-job
# small evidence is tracked -- final.data + log.lammps per job. Layout after
# the Q1 evidence commits: jobs/sb16L_*/ holds the 6f889bd smoke-era
# inputs+outputs (in.lammps, system.data, smoke prod.dump/equil.dump/
# final.data) plus the retrieved RUN log.lammps (c2daf75); the retrieved RUN
# final.data live in sb16L_*/ (retrieval location) and are tracked. The
# oversized series -- sb16L_*/equil.dump (~20 MB each, the run's own
# equilibration dump), sb16L_*/prod_thinned.dump (~200 MB each, the 1/12
# series) and the transfer bundle confirmatory_results.tar.gz (~980 MB) --
# stay local-only and move to the D50 release archive (Q4), which carries
# their sha256 manifest. sb16L_*/log.lammps is fenced as a byte-identical
# duplicate of the committed jobs/ copy. NOTE (Q1 finding): the committed
# series_manifest.json pins, 54/54 exactly, the SMOKE-era jobs/ artifacts
# (its sb16L_e0_b1/equil.dump record is the 0-byte empty-file hash), not the
# retrieved run series -- the run artifacts were sha256-pinned nowhere until
# the Q4 archive manifest.
jobs/*
!jobs/.gitkeep
!jobs/*/
jobs/*/*
!jobs/*/final.data
!jobs/*/log.lammps
!jobs/*/equil.dump
sb16L_*/equil.dump
sb16L_*/log.lammps
sb16L_*/prod_thinned.dump
confirmatory_results.tar.gz
confirmatory
